# What a CI job installs by name in a workflow step and no requirements file
# or pyproject extra declares. compile.py resolves these with the rest, so the
# step can install them under the same constraints file as everything else.

# The dashboard suite's test client (ci.yml, the autoresearch job). The page
# itself does not import it, so contrib/dashboard/requirements.txt has no pin.
